有创意工坊，失去长久生命力，官方现已停止更新。剧情存在感稀薄，配件不能手动拆卸，部分换弹动画存在bug。对抗模式内容拉胯，基本没人玩。\n\n建议：\n✅适合：有固定队友，喜欢研究卡组build，刷合作关卡的玩家。史低价入手很香。\n❌不适合：单人玩家、求生之路纯粹老粉、讨厌卡牌养成机制的人。[/h1]", "timestamp_created": 1788039074, "timestamp_updated": 1788039690, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32371", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 D v2", "vram_size": 24035}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "234001323", "author": {"steamid": "76561198414976971", "personaname": "萌新", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198414976971/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 897, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 897, "playtime_at_review": 897, "last_played": 1788020548, "avatar": "79a8119bd2a027755f93872d0d09b959909a0405"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "战斗爽！！！", "timestamp_created": 1788020573, "timestamp_updated": 1788020573, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233971973", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145447514", "personaname": "卖羊肉串串的", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198145447514/", "num_games_owned": 133, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1256, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 380, "playtime_at_review": 1074, "last_played": 1788007159, "avatar": "030992ae58a96e1c5923b88a96d9845ca0b21e4f"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "优秀的枪械质感/击杀反馈+属性流派构筑=爽，不过很多图确实是太暗了